    "BLAKE_RIFTER_PASSIVE_RIFT_BOOST_DESCRIPTION": "使敌人原地定身，并在3秒内降低其30点护甲。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_PRIMARY_GAUNTLET_RANGED": "聚焦裂隙",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_PRIMARY_GAUNTLET_RANGED_DESCRIPTION": "瞄准并射出一道裂隙，造成<style=cIsDamage>350%伤害</style>。在最大距离处触发<style=cIsDamage>暴击</style>。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_PRIMARY_BUCKSHOT": "汇聚裂隙",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_PRIMARY_BUCKSHOT_DESCRIPTION": "瞄准并射出六道裂隙，每道造成<style=cIsDamage>100%伤害</style>。无视地形。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SECONDARY_FAULT_LINE": "休眠裂隙",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SECONDARY_FAULT_LINE_DESCRIPTION": "瞄准并抛出一道休眠裂隙，最多可激活四次，每次造成<style=cIsDamage>300%伤害</style>。第五次激活时造成<style=cIsDamage>600%伤害</style>。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SECONDARY_WARP_RIFT": "跃迁裂隙",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SECONDARY_WARP_RIFT_DESCRIPTION": "瞄准并跃迁至一道裂隙，造成<style=cIsDamage>450%伤害</style>。在最大距离处触发<style=cIsDamage>暴击</style>。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_UTILITY_SLIPSTREAM": "滑流",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_UTILITY_PRESTIGE_SLIPSTREAM": "至臻滑流",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_UTILITY_SLIPSTREAM_DESCRIPTION": "向后<style=cIsUtility>传送</style>，留下一个将敌人拉向中心的漩涡。按住可维持位置和<style=cIsUtility>无敌</style>状态最多3秒。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SPECIAL_TIMELOCK": "时间锁",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SPECIAL_TIMELOCK_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealth>碾压</style>。生成一个施加粉碎并使被裂隙击中的敌人传送至自身位置的力场。<style=cIsUtility>用裂隙击中力场</style>会使时间锁坍缩，造成<style=cIsDamage>500%伤害</style>。",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SPECIAL_RECURSION_SCEPTER": "归于奇点",
    "BLAKE_RIFTER_SPECIAL_RECURSION_DESCRIPTION_SCEPTER": "布设10道叠加的裂隙，造成<style=cIsDamage>350%伤害</style><style=cStack>（每道裂隙* 120%）</style>。每道裂隙都比上一道<style=cIsDamage>小5%</style>。",
